<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Real estate guidance and thoughtful project coordination for your next move.">
  <title>[Your Name] | Real Estate & Project Support</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #20302c;
      --muted: #5e6b64;
      --cream: #f7f5ef;
      --paper: #fffefa;
      --green: #355c4b;
      --green-dark: #284638;
      --sage: #dce6dc;
      --line: #d9ddd5;
      --accent: #c27d53;
      --serif: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      --sans: "Avenir Next", Avenir, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }

    .wrap {
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px));
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .topbar {
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(32, 48, 44, .1);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: .92rem;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--green); }

    .nav-cta {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--green);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: clamp(76px, 12vw, 144px) 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 30%, rgba(220, 230, 220, .9), transparent 36%),
        var(--cream);
    }

    .hero::after {
      position: absolute;
      right: -85px;
      bottom: -185px;
      width: 430px;
      height: 430px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(53, 92, 75, .14);
      border-radius: 50%;
      content: "";
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.12;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 590px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.13rem;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--green);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      font-size: .94rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: var(--green-dark);
    }

    .button.secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .button.secondary:hover {
      background: var(--sage);
    }

    section { padding: 88px 0; }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .section-heading p,
    .service-card p,
    .about-copy p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .services {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .service-card {
      min-height: 310px;
      padding: 32px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .service-number {
      display: inline-grid;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--sage);
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-family: var(--serif);
    }

    .service-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .text-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .about {
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 64px;
    }

    .about-label {
      padding-top: 8px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .about-copy h2 { max-width: 580px; }

    .about-copy p { max-width: 650px; }

    .contact {
      padding-bottom: 96px;
    }

    .contact-box {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 32px;
      padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 56px);
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
    }

    .contact-box h2 {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .contact-box p {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .8);
    }

    .contact-box .button {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border-color: white;
      background: white;
      color: var(--green-dark);
    }

    .contact-box .button:hover {
      background: var(--sage);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 26px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .84rem;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    footer p { margin: 0; }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .wrap { width: min(100% - 36px, 1120px); }

      .nav { align-items: flex-start; }
      .nav-links { gap: 14px; }
      .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }

      .hero { padding: 82px 0 94px; }
      section { padding: 68px 0; }
      .services, .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-grid { gap: 24px; }
      .service-card { min-height: auto; }
      .contact-box { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="wrap nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#home">[Your Name]</a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="wrap hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Real estate · Project support · [Your area]</p>
        <h1>A thoughtful partner for your next chapter.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          Whether you’re finding a place to call home or planning what comes next,
          get clear guidance and steady support from start to finish.
        </p>
        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="button" href="#services">Explore services</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="#contact">Let’s talk</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">How I can help</p>
          <h2>Two kinds of support.<br>One trusted point of contact.</h2>
          <p>
            From a real estate decision to the practical planning around it,
            I help make each step feel more manageable.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="services">
          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
            <h3>Real estate guidance</h3>
            <p>
              Personalized support for buying or selling, with clear communication
              and local insight throughout the process.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="mailto:[your-email@example.com]?subject=Real%20estate%20inquiry">
              Ask about real estate
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
            <h3>Project planning & coordination</h3>
            <p>
              Practical help organizing your next steps, connecting with relevant
              professionals, and keeping the details moving.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="mailto:[your-email@example.com]?subject=Project%20support%20inquiry">
              Ask about project support
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <div class="wrap about-grid">
        <div class="about-label">A little about me</div>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>Good decisions start with a good conversation.</h2>
          <p>
            I’m [Your Name], serving [Your service area]. I believe the best
            guidance is personal, straightforward, and shaped around what matters
            to you—not a one-size-fits-all plan.
          </p>
          <p>
            Tell me what you’re working toward, and we’ll figure out the right
            next step together.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="contact-box">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow" style="color: #dce6dc;">Start here</p>
            <h2>Have a move or project in mind?</h2>
            <p>
              Share a little about what you need. I’ll be in touch to arrange a
              time to talk.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="button" href="mailto:[your-email@example.com]">Email [Your Name]</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footer-inner">
      <p>© <span id="year">2026</span> [Your Name]. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>[Brokerage name] · [Required brokerage or licensing disclosure]</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
